---
interface Props {language?:'ko'|'en'}
const {language='ko'}=Astro.props; const ko=language==='ko';
---
<section class="gpu-lab" data-gpu-lab data-language={language}>
<h3>{ko?'GPU 경제성 실험':'GPU Economics Explorer'}</h3><p>{ko?'모든 입력값은 가상 시나리오입니다. 품질과 워크로드가 같다고 가정합니다.':'All inputs are hypothetical. Equal quality and workload are assumed.'}</p>
<h4>{ko?'추론 비용과 손익분기 임대료':'Inference cost and break-even rent'}</h4>
<div class="inputs"><label>{ko?'구형 GPU 시간당 가격 ($)':'Older GPU $/hour'} <input name="oldPrice" type="number" value="1.5" min="0" step="0.1" /></label><label>{ko?'구형 GPU 초당 토큰':'Older GPU tokens/second'} <input name="oldTps" type="number" value="40" min="1" /></label><label>{ko?'신형 GPU 시간당 가격 ($)':'New GPU $/hour'} <input name="newPrice" type="number" value="4" min="0" step="0.1" /></label><label>{ko?'신형 GPU 초당 토큰':'New GPU tokens/second'} <input name="newTps" type="number" value="120" min="1" /></label></div>
<p aria-live="polite" data-result>{ko?'구형 손익분기 가격: $1.33/시간':'Older break-even price: $1.33/hour'}</p>
<h4>{ko?'자산 현금흐름: 가상 사례':'Asset cash flow: hypothetical case'}</h4><label><input name="linkBreakEven" type="checkbox" /> {ko?'위의 손익분기 가격을 자산 임대료에 적용':'Apply the break-even price above to the asset rental rate'}</label><div class="inputs"><label>{ko?'시간당 임대료 ($)':'Rental $/hour'} <input name="rent" type="number" value="3" min="0" step="0.1" /></label><label>{ko?'유료 가동률 (0–1)':'Paid utilization (0–1)'} <input name="util" type="number" value="0.7" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" /></label><label>{ko?'할인율 (0–1)':'Discount rate (0–1)'} <input name="discount" type="number" value="0.12" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" /></label><label>{ko?'최초 3년 계약':'First three-year contract'} <select name="contract"><option value="on_demand">On-demand</option><option value="take_or_pay">Take-or-pay · 98% availability</option></select></label></div>
<p aria-live="polite" data-npv>NPV: −$16,315</p><p>{ko?'GPU $30,000 + 인프라 $12,000, 운영·유지 $7,500/년. 계약 만료 후 70% 갱신확률, 가격 55%, 이후 연 12% 하락. 6년 말 잔존 $3,000. 세금 0. 최적 처분·교체 시점과 IRR은 계산하지 않습니다.':'GPU $30,000 + infrastructure $12,000; annual operating and maintenance $7,500. After expiry: 70% renewal probability, 55% price, then 12% annual decline. $3,000 salvage in year six. Tax zero. Optimal retirement and IRR are not calculated.'}</p>
<h4>{ko?'계약 종료 후: 계속 운영 또는 즉시 매각':'After expiry: continue operating or sell now'}</h4>
<p>{ko?'가상 사례. 남은 3년의 기대 현금흐름을 계약 종료 시점으로 할인합니다. 기존 취득원가는 매몰비용이며, 아래 매각대금과 별도로 차감하지 않습니다.':'Hypothetical case. Remaining three-year expected cash flows are discounted to the expiry date. Acquisition cost is sunk and is not deducted again from sale proceeds.'}</p>
<div class="inputs"><label>{ko?'재계약 가격 ($/시간)':'Renewal rent ($/hour)'} <input name="renewRent" type="number" min="0" value="1.65" step="0.1" /></label><label>{ko?'재계약 확률 (0–1)':'Renewal probability (0–1)'} <input name="renewProb" type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" value="0.7" /></label><label>{ko?'즉시 처분대금 ($)':'Sale proceeds now ($)'} <input name="sellNow" type="number" min="0" step="100" value="4000" /></label></div>
<p aria-live="polite" data-continuation></p><p>{ko?'남은 3년: 위의 유료 가동률·할인율을 사용, 재계약 가격 연 12% 하락, 운영·유지비 연 $7,500, 3년 말 잔존가치 $3,000. 갱신 실패에도 운영비 발생. 세금·부채·교체 및 전용 가치는 제외한 조건부 비교입니다.':'Remaining three years use utilization and discount rate above, 12% annual price decline, $7,500 annual operating and maintenance costs, and $3,000 terminal salvage. Costs remain even if renewal fails. Conditional comparison excludes tax, debt, replacement and alternative-use value.'}</p>
</section>
<script>
document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-gpu-lab]').forEach(root=>{const ko=root.dataset.language==='ko';const n=(name:string)=>Number(root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>(`[name="${name}"]`)?.value);const render=()=>{const a=n('oldPrice'),b=n('oldTps'),c=n('newPrice'),d=n('newTps'),inputRent=n('rent'),linked=root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[name="linkBreakEven"]')!.checked,rent=linked?c*b/d:inputRent,u=n('util'),r=n('discount');const out=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-result]')!,npvOut=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-npv]')!;if(![a,b,c,d,rent,u,r].every(Number.isFinite)||a<0||c<0||rent<0||b<=0||d<=0||u<0||u>1||r<0){out.textContent=ko?'입력을 확인하세요.':'Check inputs.';npvOut.textContent='—';return}const oldCost=1e6*a/(3600*b),newCost=1e6*c/(3600*d);out.textContent=(ko?'구형 손익분기 가격: ':'Older break-even price: ')+`$${(c*b/d).toFixed(2)}/h · `+(ko?'백만 토큰당 비용 (구형 / 신형): ':'Cost per million tokens (old / new): ')+`$${oldCost.toFixed(2)} / $${newCost.toFixed(2)}`;let npv=-42000,zero=-42000,unit=-42000;const kind=root.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('[name="contract"]')!.value;for(let t=1;t<=6;t++){const demand=kind==='take_or_pay'&&t<=3?.98:u;const renewal=t<=3?1:.7;const price=t<=3?rent:rent*.55*Math.pow(.88,t-4);const flow=8760*demand*renewal*price-7500+(t===6?3000:0);const factor=1/Math.pow(1+r,t);npv+=flow*factor;const fixed=-7500+(t===6?3000:0);zero+=fixed*factor;unit+=(8760*demand*renewal*(t<=3?1:.55*Math.pow(.88,t-4))+fixed)*factor}const required=unit>zero?-zero/(unit-zero):NaN;const renewRent=n('renewRent'),renewProb=n('renewProb'),sellNow=n('sellNow'),cont=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-continuation]')!;let continuation=0;if([renewRent,renewProb,sellNow].every(Number.isFinite)&&renewRent>=0&&renewProb>=0&&renewProb<=1&&sellNow>=0){for(let t=1;t<=3;t++){continuation+=(8760*u*renewProb*renewRent*Math.pow(.88,t-1)-7500+(t===3?3000:0))/Math.pow(1+r,t)}cont.textContent=`${ko?'계속 운영 가치':'Continue value'}: ${continuation<0?'−':''}$${Math.abs(continuation).toFixed(0)} · ${ko?'즉시 매각':'Sell now'}: $${sellNow.toFixed(0)} · ${continuation>sellNow?(ko?'계속 운영 우위':'Continue is higher'):(ko?'즉시 매각이 같거나 높음':'Sell now is equal or higher')}`}else{cont.textContent=ko?'재계약 입력을 확인하세요.':'Check renewal inputs.'}npvOut.textContent=`${ko?'적용 임대료':'Applied rent'}: $${rent.toFixed(2)}/h · NPV: ${npv<0?'−':''}$${Math.abs(npv).toFixed(0)} · ${ko?'공급자 NPV 0 임대료':'Supplier NPV-zero rent'}: ${Number.isFinite(required)?'$'+required.toFixed(2)+'/h':'—'}`;};root.querySelectorAll('input,select').forEach(e=>e.addEventListener('input',render));render();});
</script>
<style>.gpu-lab{padding:1.2rem;border:1px solid #9aaec4;border-radius:12px;background:#f5f8fc;color:#25344a}.inputs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.8rem}.inputs label{display:grid;gap:.3rem;font-size:.85rem}.inputs input,.inputs select{width:100%;padding:.5rem}.gpu-lab [aria-live]{font-weight:700}.gpu-lab p{line-height:1.6}@media(max-width:600px){.inputs{grid-template-columns:1fr}}:global(html.dark) .gpu-lab{background:#202a38;color:#eee}</style>
